{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumUniverses.CategoricalHodgeStarUnique","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumUniverses.CategoricalHodgeStarUnique","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.Structures"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalHodgeStar.unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalHodgeStar.unique","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/categorical-hodge-star-unique.lean#L39-L55","doc":"**Uniqueness of the categorical Hodge star (proved).**\n\nTwo `CatHodgeInvolution X` terms with the same underlying involution\nmorphism coincide: involutivity is propositional, so the `star`\nfield is the whole content.  This replaces a false\n`Subsingleton (CatHodgeInvolution X)` axiom (the `star` field is\nfree data) with the extensionality the structure genuinely\nsupports. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:categorical-hodge-star-unique","label":"prop:categorical-hodge-star-unique","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/categorical-hodge-star-unique.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}